{"author":"schacon@gmail.com","body":"Add a code review workflow tied to tickets. A ticket with a code URI (ti code) should support review comments attached to specific files/lines.\n\nPossible commands:\n- ti review <id> — start a review, show the diff for the ticket's code branch\n- ti review comment <file>:<line> \"message\" — leave a review comment\n- ti review approve / ti review request-changes — set review status\n- ti review list — show pending reviews\n\nReview state could be stored as ticket metadata or a dedicated field. Should integrate with the existing code URI field."}